---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy and contact"
  description="Privacy guidance for The True Hive's public showcase, URL-based collection search, managed hosting, and external contact links."
>
  <section class="page-intro wrap" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Keep things clear</p>
    <h1 id="privacy-title">
      Privacy,
      <br />
      <em>without surprises.</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      This first site provides collection and service information. It does not
      accept orders, take payment, create customer accounts, or collect
      inquiry-form submissions.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap prose-section">
    <h2>Browsing this site</h2>
    <p>
      No advertising pixel, social-feed embed, or first-party customer analytics
      has been added to this public showcase. Managed hosting may still process
      requests and access or security logs; the final provider-specific
      disclosure must be reviewed before public launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Collection search</h2>
    <p>
      Collection search uses a public GET request. Search terms and category
      filter choices are included in the URL, so they can appear in browser
      history, copied or shared links, and potentially hosting access or
      security logs.
    </p>
    <p>
      The application creates no search profile or search-history storage of its
      own. Avoid entering sensitive information in the collection search.
      Clearing the filters changes the results; it does not erase previously
      recorded URLs or request logs.
    </p>
    <h2>Contacting us elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      If you use an approved phone or social-profile link, the call or platform
      interaction takes place outside this website and is subject to that
      provider's behavior. Email setup remains deferred.
    </p>
    <p>
      Contact channels may still be pending. This website does not submit
      inquiries or feedback on your behalf.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/#connect">
      Check contact channels <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
    </a>
    <h2>Separate, restricted workflows</h2>
    <p>
      Restricted administrator authentication is separate from public browsing;
      it is not a customer account feature. Any future checkout, invoicing, or
      other financial workflow remains separately gated. These public browsing
      notes are not a claim that no data is processed anywhere in the system.
    </p>
    <h2>Before online sales</h2>
    <p>
      Checkout, customer information, retention, owner access, and privacy
      disclosures will be reviewed before those features are enabled. No
      retention period or finalized policy for future sales is established by
      these current-showcase notes.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
